      "writtenOn": "2023-04-27T09:59:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "CMake is looking for fan.c file in the board derictory.\nWithout it twister fails with:\n```\nCMake Error at /home/korneld/chromiumos/src/third_party/zephyr/main/cmake/modules/extensions.cmake:424 (add_library):\n  Cannot find source file:\n\n    /home/korneld/chromiumos/src/platform/ec/zephyr/program/skyrim/winterhold/src/fan.c\n```\n\nI\u0027ve narrowed it down to https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/4479371/1/zephyr/test/skyrim/tests/common/CMakeLists.txt#b17, though I\u0027m not familiar enough with EC testing infrastructure to say why it\u0027s there.\nI didn\u0027t want to edit the \"common\" fan test config, hence this patch.",
      "parentUuid": "15991d44_4fc67df0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 10,
        "startChar": 13,
        "endLine": 10,
        "endChar": 62
      },
      "revId": "529fb159048a02b754c31ef015f0c40dac264779",
