      "lineNbr": 16,
      "author": {
        "id": 1297197
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-04-26T17:00:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The other skyrim `CMakeLists.txt` use `CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_FAN`. I understand you\u0027re using `CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_CUSTOM_FAN_DUTY_CONTROL`, since that\u0027s what\u0027s being referenced in `shim/src/fan.c`, but the difference looks a bit odd.\n\nThis also means the file cannot be included for overriding things like `fan_init()`, since `PLATFORM_EC_CUSTOM_FAN_DUTY_CONTROL` does not depend on `PLATFORM_EC_FAN` (meaning `PLATFORM_EC_CUSTOM_FAN_DUTY_CONTROL` does not also imply `PLATFORM_EC_FAN`.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 16,
        "startChar": 29,
        "endLine": 16,
        "endChar": 71
      },
      "revId": "529fb159048a02b754c31ef015f0c40dac264779",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
