        "id": 1565377
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-04-27T09:59:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good catch. I believe that the missing dependency is a bug.\nFrom what I can see `PLATFORM_EC_CUSTOM_FAN_CONTROL` has the same problem. We should add dependencies for both of them in a separate patch.\nI suppose that no one caught it before since `PLATFORM_EC_FAN` is set by default.\n\nWould you like me to open a new bug to track that?",
      "parentUuid": "16fdcb13_f244fc39",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 16,
        "startChar": 29,
        "endLine": 16,
        "endChar": 71
      },
      "revId": "529fb159048a02b754c31ef015f0c40dac264779",
