      "message": "CONFIG_PLATFORM_EC_CUSTOM_FAN_DUTY_CONTROL should have a `depends on PLATFORM_EC_FAN`.  That was an oversight with the original CL. \n\nKornel - can you fix that as a separate CL in this stack?\n\nIt probably makes sense to rename `fan.c` to `fan_duty_control.c` so that it\u0027s obvious that this file is only used fro the custom fan duty code and can easily be removed later.",
